              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rum 15:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Itu asis ato ngetuno pöytoghintö nyo rel ara Yese nyo ghyongöy kïlïku kiporunöt ompö pipö punton. Pkonöy pich kïtuyegho kanasyantenyi nyo töror akutö nyinte konyït. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pöghisyegho Echotyon ngat owesyenyi kuyokunö pikachi pïnotön ato itï asisoni kïmïlisyö korengwa cho kidong koro Asirya nko Misri ompö koroswo pipö Patros nko Etopya nko Elam nko Papilonia nko Amat nko koros cho mi nanam cho kiwit pögh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay kïsyol ECHOTYON pentera nyo porchini pipö punton lö kaghamït nyinte pipö Israel nko cho pö Yuda cho kitoytoyö kïngetunö luchtin angwan cho pö ngwïny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amelö tökwomchini paytaghpa Israel Yuda nyonyintön ngat, amelö tökïlïku Yuda pung pö Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pokyini chane kwodeny pipö Pilisti ompö okumpö ta, akïnam cho möngöy kongasis. Poryegho pipö Edom nko cho pö Moap akïrïnta, atolapay kïterchï pipö Amon chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ngo 16:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ighöy ECHOTYON Nanam nyo ipöy pögh lalwa Misri kïteny, akïyonï yomat nyo layate kungwïn kïpel lalwa Yuparet kïteny lakaw, kïpoto kori pöghon cho le mut nko odeny cho kosuno pögh, atökumï chi anka tïkwïl kwoghyö antakwagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akïrumunö or nyo wow nyo pkono pipö Israel cho le ngötunön koro Asirya kïkarkegh nko wölo kilïkwï asis nyo kingetunö pikökwa koro Misri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.11.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tum pö sörö",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
